      "reasons": [
        "The packet only provides context that a specific biomarker (Ln_LHR) shows a “clinically meaningful threshold effect” on 28-day mortality in sepsis, and does not support a general definition of “threshold effect” as a pattern in “assessment” across measures.",
        "The definition’s claim that the prognosis link is “not simply gradual across all values” is not stated or evidenced in the packet.",
        "The packet does not support the wording about “practical meaning for estimating risk or outcome” as a general feature of the term; it only describes prognostic use in a sepsis mortality setting."
